How they were made
  `icons.dll` is read as PE resource data with `pelite`, never loaded. Its named resource
  type `ICONS` holds 3845 whole `.ICO` files named `XF_<SHORTNAME>.ICO`; an Xfire game's
  icon is the one named by the first `ShortName` of its `xfire_games.ini` sections, in file
  order. Each `.ICO`'s largest image is kept: a PNG copied, a DIB converted with its AND
  mask (a 32-bit DIB's own alpha when any is set).
  3827 files written; 36 Xfire games have no icon; 19 icons name no game and are not
  written:
